Z||000004||Ronen||05-23-2001||06:42 PM||||I just looked closer. The diamond spoke wheels are '15. My originals are only '14. That changes everything. But, I have another question. Does 15 inch wheels hurt performance in my Fiero GT V6 85?||||reg||10
Z||000005||spideyfoot||05-23-2001||06:55 PM||||Should help less sidewall therefore less roll in corners. That's why those Trans am racers and such use the big wheel lower profile tire the tires flex the wheels don't. ||||reg||1
